@startuml
title UC-001 — 격리된 행동 평가 케이스 실행
note as N
Product 명세 UC-001
end note
actor "workflow 유지 관리자/사용자" as Maintainer
actor "Codex 에이전트" as Codex
actor harness as Harness
actor "평가자/검토자" as Evaluator
actor "통제된 외부 시스템" as External
rectangle "행동 평가 케이스" {
  usecase "케이스, Required Outcome,\nHard Gates, 품질 임계값 정의" as Define
  usecase "폐기 가능한 격리\nworkspace와 recording 준비" as Provision
  usecase "실제 workflow 실행" as Execute
  usecase "게이트와 결과 검증;\ntask/trajectory 품질 채점" as Evaluate
  usecase "trajectory, evidence,\n케이스 결과 보존" as Retain
  usecase "workspace와 격리 초기화" as Reset
}
Maintainer --> Define
Define --> Provision
Harness --> Provision
Harness --> Execute
Codex --> Execute
External --> Execute
Execute --> Evaluate
Evaluator --> Evaluate
Evaluate --> Retain
Harness --> Retain
Retain --> Reset
Harness --> Reset
note right of Execute
fail_fast side-effect 위반은 즉시 중단한다;
non-side-effect 정책 위반은 완료까지 계속한 뒤
failed로 종료한다.
end note
@enduml
